{{Short description|Soup made of potatoes and sour rye}}
[[File:Zalewajka pomorska from Pila.JPG|thumb|Zalewajka from [[Piła]]]]
'''Zalewajka'''<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.gov.pl/web/rolnictwo/zalewajka|title=Zalewajka|website=gov.pl}}</ref> is a traditional rustic [[soup]] made of diced and boiled [[potato]]es and overflowed with sour rye made from [[sourdough]] bread. It also often contains [[Kielbasa|Polish sausage]] and dried [[Edible mushrooms|mushrooms]].
